  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố ““ Viên bi lấy ra màu đỏ””&thinsp; và\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố ““ Viên bi có dán nhãn””.\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Sai.<br>\n\t\t\tTổng số bi trong hộp là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></semantics></math> viên bi.</li><li>Sai.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>40</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Sai.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>30</mn><mn>40</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đúng.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>60</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
